{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pointdexter is a 2D puzzle platformer where tiles can be drawn, and will move in the same direction as you do. Use pencils, erasers, and even other doodles to solve every puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Artist hasn\u2019t been able to draw due to artist\u2019s block. Well? Go find this block and blow it to pieces. Play as Pointdexter, a doodle in The Artist\u2019s sketchbook, and draw tiles with your trusty pencils to reach new pages and put an end to the artist\u2019s block.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3429830?t=1738843244","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738843244","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429830/079adb09d20a56a2a65fce9da8b8f71c43d3cdc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738843244","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429830/079adb09d20a56a2a65fce9da8b8f71c43d3cdc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738843244","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pointdexter is a 2D puzzle platformer where tiles can be drawn, and will move in the same direction as you do. Use pencils, erasers, and even other doodles to solve every puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Artist hasn\u2019t been able to draw due to artist\u2019s block. Well? Go find this block and blow it to pieces. Play as Pointdexter, a doodle in The Artist\u2019s sketchbook, and draw tiles with your trusty pencils to reach new pages and put an end to the artist\u2019s block.</p>","developers":["Usu Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429830/header.jpg?t=1738843244","is_free":false,"linux_re